## Summary
The Trump Administration has proposed a new fee structure for H-1B visas, which are work visas for skilled foreign workers in the U.S. This move is part of broader immigration policy adjustments, potentially affecting businesses and international talent recruitment.

## Key Points
- The Trump Administration is proposing changes to the fee system for H-1B visas.
- This proposal could increase costs for employers hiring foreign skilled workers.
- The changes are part of ongoing U.S. immigration policy reforms.


